WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.100
 

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.000
Once upon a time,

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.800
in a beautiful wood,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.020
there lived a rabbit named Peter

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.060
with a blue jacket..

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.400
 

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.760
[ wings flapping]
 Peter: Sorry!

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.120
.. And no pants.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.700
♪ [Feel it still by Portugal. The Man]♪

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.980
Peter: Come one in!  We've got the garden.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:21.800
Peter: Help yourself to anything.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.100
Peter: Wait, didnt you try to eat me?

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.100
Peter: Show me your teeth.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.100
Peter: Do like a-, go like- [growls]

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.400
Mr. Tod: [Growls]

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.520
Peter: It was you! I knew it! How are you? So good to see you.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.900
♪Ooh woo, I'm a rebel just for kicks now♪

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.600
♪I've been feeling it since 1966, now♪

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.500
♪Might be over now, but i feel it still♪

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.300
Mr.Tod: Commando!!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:47.140
"Oh yeah, now its a party."

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:50.800
Peter: I can't think of one thing that can possibly stop our fun.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:53.000
"McGreggor is coming!"

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.000
"Everyone hide!"

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.160
[Music stops]

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.340
McGreggor: [sighs]

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.940
McGreggor: Aaaaah!

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:16.980
Pig: Waaaaah!

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.280
McGreggor: Aaaaahh!

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.000
Pig: [screams in pig]

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Both: [scream]

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.700
[birds flapping, screaming, footsteps]

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:27.300
[Moooo!]

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.660
Peter: This is only the beginning.

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:30.420
Peter: HaHa!

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:33.880
[Brakes screech]

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.400
[crickets chirping]

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.100
Peter: Phyllis, blink, blink!

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:40.820
Phillips: Headlights.

